WEBVTT

00:13.880 --> 00:14.670
Huh?

00:15.990 --> 00:16.950
Huh?

00:19.410 --> 00:20.660
I beat it?

00:20.870 --> 00:23.980
It seems like a tough one.
I wonder what my level is now.

00:23.980 --> 00:25.350
Status Open.

00:27.060 --> 00:29.710
<b></b>82,287,920

00:28.900 --> 00:29.710
<b></b>Enemy of All Monsters
Dragon Killer

00:29.710 --> 00:31.810
Crap! I overdid it!

00:31.810 --> 00:33.690
My magic is over 80 million,
and I got the aliases

00:33.690 --> 00:37.090
"Enemy of All Monsters" and "Dragon Killer"?!

00:39.510 --> 00:42.350
<i>I reincarnated as a noble,</i>

00:42.740 --> 00:47.560
<i>but the gods gave me level-10 protections,
so my status is off the charts.</i>

00:48.850 --> 00:53.050
<i>But that's a secret to everyone!</i>

01:03.200 --> 01:06.080
The Aristocrat's
<b>Otherworldly Adventure:
Serving Gods Who Go Too Far</b>

02:23.510 --> 02:27.850
"To the Royal Capital"

02:23.510 --> 02:27.850
"To the Royal Capital"

02:25.000 --> 02:30.170
<i>Two years later, I headed to the
royal capital to make my debut.</i>

02:30.780 --> 02:34.790
<i>Apparently, it's an event all
noble sons must go through.</i>

02:34.790 --> 02:36.460
<i>I also...</i>

02:36.460 --> 02:38.170
<i>turned ten years old.</i>

02:38.480 --> 02:41.900
I can't wait to live with you in the capital!

02:41.900 --> 02:45.430
You should just take the entry exams
 and start attending school.

02:45.640 --> 02:49.530
School attendance starts at age twelve,
so he has two more years.

02:49.960 --> 02:54.690
Sister Reine, you're looking forward
to starting school, aren't you?

02:54.690 --> 02:57.750
I'll take the number one
ranks on the school's exam

02:57.750 --> 03:00.820
and work hard as your big sister!

03:01.630 --> 03:03.910
I'll be rooting for you. Father...

03:05.000 --> 03:07.720
How long will it take to get to the capital?

03:07.720 --> 03:10.260
Oh, about a week.

03:10.260 --> 03:12.460
Assuming no monsters get in the way, that is.

03:12.690 --> 03:13.920
I see.

03:14.380 --> 03:19.080
<i>I should be on the alert for any
attacks to help out the guards.</i>

03:19.590 --> 03:20.630
<i>Search!</i>

03:24.770 --> 03:27.930
Father, bad news! There's a battle
going on three kilometers ahead!

03:28.220 --> 03:28.890
What?!

03:29.100 --> 03:31.380
You can read that far ahead?

03:31.380 --> 03:32.060
Yes.

03:32.370 --> 03:36.500
A few dozen monsters are
swarming about ten people.

03:36.500 --> 03:37.520
We have to hurry!

03:38.930 --> 03:40.160
Move faster!

03:40.160 --> 03:43.350
Monsters are attacking
three kilometers ahead!

03:43.350 --> 03:45.560
You boys go on up there!

03:45.560 --> 03:46.450
R-Right!

03:49.150 --> 03:50.200
Father!

03:50.480 --> 03:53.500
They won't make it in time! I'll go, too!

03:54.150 --> 03:56.460
What are you doing, Cain?! That's dangerous!

03:56.460 --> 04:00.130
I'll be fine. You assigned
tutors for me, after all!

04:00.670 --> 04:01.470
Cain!

04:01.700 --> 04:04.660
Wind magic: Boost!

04:02.950 --> 04:04.150
<b>Boost</b>

04:05.010 --> 04:06.350
Cain!

04:08.160 --> 04:09.260
What was that?

04:09.260 --> 04:10.140
The wind?

04:10.140 --> 04:10.850
A bird?

04:10.850 --> 04:14.390
Cain! Take care, now!

04:25.100 --> 04:28.240
Protect this carriage,
no matter what it takes!

04:30.950 --> 04:32.540
Princess!

04:32.540 --> 04:33.750
I'll help you!

04:33.750 --> 04:35.210
Air Cutter!

04:35.550 --> 04:37.610
A child shouldn't be out here!

04:38.410 --> 04:39.960
Air Bullet!

04:41.510 --> 04:43.260
Air Cutter!

04:46.910 --> 04:50.100
Wait, I can't. Magic would
hurt the knights, too.

04:56.110 --> 04:56.690
And that...

04:57.290 --> 04:58.940
just leaves you!

05:02.860 --> 05:06.270
Fire Sword!

05:13.080 --> 05:14.370
Are you all right?

05:14.640 --> 05:17.830
D-Don't come near this carriage!
Stay right there!

05:20.720 --> 05:22.190
I failed to introduce myself.

05:22.530 --> 05:26.180
I am the third son of
Margrave Garm von Silford...

05:27.050 --> 05:29.510
Cain von Silford.

05:29.510 --> 05:31.730
Th-The margrave's son?

05:33.270 --> 05:35.100
You can rest at ease now!

05:35.360 --> 05:38.190
We are knights of the
Margrave of Gracia—wait...

05:38.530 --> 05:40.650
What is Master Cain doing here?

05:40.650 --> 05:43.330
And... all the monsters are dead?

05:43.330 --> 05:44.230
What a mess...

05:46.200 --> 05:47.520
Are you all right?

05:47.990 --> 05:49.020
The princess...

05:49.560 --> 05:52.960
Please, don't speak. I can use healing magic.

05:52.960 --> 05:55.200
Would you allow me to heal everyone?

05:55.200 --> 05:56.210
Are you...

05:56.210 --> 05:58.870
Healing first! Area High Heal!

06:05.690 --> 06:07.340
What is this?!

06:11.140 --> 06:15.060
Now, just rest, and try to eat foods
that encourage blood production.

06:15.560 --> 06:18.160
I can't replace the blood that you've lost.

06:18.710 --> 06:20.730
And... I can't help these people.

06:25.930 --> 06:27.780
J-Just who are—

06:28.090 --> 06:30.090
I am Garm von Silford!

06:30.090 --> 06:33.490
I've come to assist this carriage!
Is everyone safe?!

06:34.010 --> 06:35.200
Wait, Cain?

06:35.590 --> 06:37.910
I wondered why you suddenly jumped off.

06:38.250 --> 06:39.870
What a terrible scene.

06:39.870 --> 06:41.130
Yes, it is.

06:41.130 --> 06:43.420
Fill me in on the situation later.

06:45.250 --> 06:47.210
Th-That crest...

06:47.500 --> 06:50.800
It appears to be of the house
of Duke Santana! Is he safe?

06:56.880 --> 06:58.060
This is...

07:01.850 --> 07:06.120
This is, without a doubt,
Princess Telestia and Miss Silk!

07:07.030 --> 07:09.150
I am glad to see you're safe.

07:09.150 --> 07:11.610
<i>The princess and the duke's daughter?!</i>

07:11.910 --> 07:14.780
M-Margrave Silford...

07:15.610 --> 07:19.270
Thank you for coming to save
us when we were in danger.

07:19.810 --> 07:20.890
And, um...

07:21.260 --> 07:22.330
Um...

07:22.540 --> 07:24.650
Huh? Ah...

07:25.060 --> 07:28.980
The one beside me is the 
third son of Garm von Silford.

07:28.980 --> 07:31.480
I am Cain von Silford.

07:31.850 --> 07:35.550
Princess Telestia and Miss Silk,

07:35.930 --> 07:37.760
I'm glad you're both safe.

07:38.610 --> 07:39.680
Teles!

07:40.200 --> 07:42.440
Forgive me for suggesting it with such haste,

07:42.440 --> 07:46.500
but would you allow me to use
magic that will calm your mind?

07:46.500 --> 07:47.610
Yes...

07:47.610 --> 07:48.820
Please.

07:49.340 --> 07:50.270
Relax.

07:49.340 --> 07:51.030
<b>Relax</b>

07:54.400 --> 07:56.520
What is this?

07:56.520 --> 08:00.080
My heart feels lighter... and lighter...

08:00.870 --> 08:04.730
Both the pain and the
exhaustion are disappearing!

08:04.730 --> 08:07.730
My heart... My heart...

08:08.440 --> 08:11.130
...is relaxing!

08:13.450 --> 08:15.800
Master Cain!

08:15.800 --> 08:17.050
I'm here.

08:18.810 --> 08:22.650
Master Cain! I am Telestia Terra Esfort.

08:23.020 --> 08:26.540
Thank you for saving us from danger.

08:26.880 --> 08:29.780
I thought we were done for!

08:30.100 --> 08:33.260
I am Silk von Santana.

08:33.650 --> 08:36.010
Allow me to thank you, as well.

08:36.440 --> 08:38.410
I saw you through the carriage window.

08:38.920 --> 08:41.740
You unleashed your magic with
the force of a mighty gale,

08:41.740 --> 08:44.370
and your swordsmanship was amazing, too!

08:44.370 --> 08:45.540
His hand is mine!

08:45.800 --> 08:47.110
No, mine!

08:47.110 --> 08:48.150
In that case...

08:48.150 --> 08:48.770
Well, then...

08:48.770 --> 08:50.000
I'll take...

08:50.000 --> 08:50.480
...this one!

08:50.480 --> 08:51.370
Please!

08:51.370 --> 08:53.660
What brings you all the
way out here, Master Cain?

08:53.660 --> 08:57.530
I-I was on my way to the royal capital.

08:57.530 --> 08:59.990
I need to be there for my debut.

08:59.990 --> 09:04.610
I see! We were on the way
to our debut, as well.

09:04.920 --> 09:07.450
Please, if you don't mind, travel with us!

09:08.170 --> 09:09.590
Yes, let's do that!

09:09.590 --> 09:12.730
We wouldn't feel safe on our own!

09:12.730 --> 09:14.190
Father!

09:14.690 --> 09:17.740
Father! Fa—

09:23.290 --> 09:25.770
<i>It's so tight... and cramped...</i>

09:25.770 --> 09:27.040
<i>The carriage is huge...</i>

09:27.040 --> 09:29.660
<i>So why do we have to sit like this?!</i>

09:30.170 --> 09:33.450
Um, why don't I sit in the front—

09:33.450 --> 09:34.170
You mustn't!

09:34.700 --> 09:38.250
I'm still scared, and I'll feel
better with you beside me.

09:38.250 --> 09:39.850
No fair! Me, too!

09:39.850 --> 09:40.850
Master Cain!

09:41.920 --> 09:44.520
Please call me "Teles."

09:44.780 --> 09:47.360
I couldn't call the princess that!

09:47.360 --> 09:49.190
As for me...

09:49.520 --> 09:51.150
You can call me "Silk."

09:51.530 --> 09:53.320
I couldn't call the duke's daughter...

09:53.570 --> 09:54.780
Teles.

09:54.780 --> 09:56.110
Silk.

09:56.110 --> 09:59.660
H-Huh?! But we only just met today...

09:59.980 --> 10:01.620
<i>Teles</i>. Understand?

10:01.620 --> 10:03.700
<i>Silk</i>. Understand?

10:05.020 --> 10:08.010
A-All right, Miss Silk and Princess Teles.

10:08.010 --> 10:09.110
No "Princess"!

10:09.110 --> 10:10.080
Teles...

10:10.080 --> 10:12.310
Oh, same for me.

10:12.310 --> 10:13.400
Miss Silk...

10:13.400 --> 10:14.760
No "Miss"!

10:14.760 --> 10:16.010
Silk!

10:16.010 --> 10:17.030
Yes?

10:17.030 --> 10:19.710
Forgive me for interrupting!

10:20.190 --> 10:22.520
We are approaching the town of Renoma.

10:23.030 --> 10:24.210
Please prepare to disembark.

10:24.210 --> 10:27.990
D-Did you see all of that?!

10:27.990 --> 10:28.810
Yes.

10:28.810 --> 10:30.510
What a disaster.

10:30.890 --> 10:34.190
Let's take some time to rest when we arrive.

10:34.590 --> 10:38.170
You'll take a break with us,
won't you, Master Cain?

10:47.050 --> 10:50.850
W-Well, I'll see you two
again in the morning...

10:50.850 --> 10:54.090
Why tomorrow? I want to
be together tonight, too.

10:54.090 --> 10:56.890
I'm scared, so I want you
with me the whole time.

10:56.890 --> 11:00.070
I want to spend the night
with Master Cain, too!

11:00.070 --> 11:02.360
I really don't think that's—

11:01.400 --> 11:02.360
True.

11:02.760 --> 11:07.340
Even if you're only ten, having girls
and boys share a room is a bit...

11:07.340 --> 11:08.480
inappropriate.

11:08.730 --> 11:13.090
But the sight of the horrific things that
 happened today won't leave my mind!

11:13.090 --> 11:17.200
What would we do if monsters
attacked us during the night?

11:17.200 --> 11:18.820
We're inside the town, though—

11:19.110 --> 11:21.780
You can't rule out a dragon attack!

11:22.100 --> 11:24.010
If that is your concern, a maid can—

11:24.010 --> 11:26.580
I want Master Cain to protect me!

11:26.580 --> 11:30.530
That's right! Master Cain
is the strongest one here, isn't he?

11:30.530 --> 11:31.500
Huh?

11:31.920 --> 11:33.830
Well, yes, that is true, but...

11:34.130 --> 11:35.300
So it's settled!

11:35.300 --> 11:37.560
Master Cain, do you not want to?

11:37.560 --> 11:39.900
You want to, don't you, Master Cain?

11:40.920 --> 11:42.810
A-All right!

11:42.810 --> 11:45.890
As long as the room we stay in is very big!

11:45.890 --> 11:48.220
Yay! We're staying with Master Cain!

11:48.570 --> 11:50.560
A-Act with prudence.

11:51.090 --> 11:53.520
Remember, you're only ten years old.

11:53.750 --> 11:54.680
Right...

11:54.680 --> 11:56.030
Right!

11:57.180 --> 11:58.980
Master Cain!

12:09.640 --> 12:13.940
Master Cain, would it be all
right if I slept next to you?

12:13.940 --> 12:16.350
I want to sleep beside Master Cain, too!

12:16.350 --> 12:18.460
In that case, Master Cain...

12:19.020 --> 12:21.050
will have to be in the middle.

12:21.360 --> 12:22.730
Oh, I know!

12:22.730 --> 12:25.080
I'm going to move my bed closer.

12:25.080 --> 12:26.560
No fair!

12:26.560 --> 12:28.880
Maybe I'll move mine closer, too!

12:29.690 --> 12:30.810
<i>We're basically...</i>

12:31.110 --> 12:34.290
<i>sleeping side-by-side
like a tight-knit family!</i>

12:32.080 --> 12:34.290
<b>River</b>

12:35.230 --> 12:36.350
Master Cain!

12:37.110 --> 12:38.320
Master Cain!

12:38.320 --> 12:41.180
W-Wait just a moment!

12:41.180 --> 12:44.240
Can't we put the beds back where they were?

12:44.240 --> 12:45.850
But the night is scary.

12:45.850 --> 12:48.700
When I think of what might
happen if monsters attack...

12:48.700 --> 12:49.660
But—

12:49.900 --> 12:53.500
I only wanted to be at least
a little bit closer to you.

12:54.510 --> 12:57.760
Are you unable to sleep with the
two of us this close to you?

12:57.760 --> 13:00.710
N-No, that's not the problem...

13:01.070 --> 13:04.180
Then, let us sleep right up against you.

13:04.180 --> 13:07.390
Can't you sleep with the two of us here?

13:07.390 --> 13:11.680
A-All right! Let's all sleep together!

13:11.680 --> 13:12.570
Yay!

13:12.570 --> 13:14.830
B-But if we're like this...

13:14.830 --> 13:18.460
I really will be too anxious to sleep!

13:25.210 --> 13:27.400
Master Cain, did you sleep well?

13:27.400 --> 13:28.570
Did you sleep well?

13:28.570 --> 13:32.280
<i>There was no way I'd get any
sleep in that situation,</i>

13:32.280 --> 13:35.610
<i>so I spent the next several
days without any sleep.</i>

13:37.360 --> 13:40.350
<i>But then our group continued
moving for a few more days,</i>

13:40.350 --> 13:43.300
<i>and finally, we arrived at the royal capital.</i>

13:45.760 --> 13:47.970
So this is the royal palace!

13:50.040 --> 13:51.390
Thank you.

13:51.860 --> 13:54.610
Your Highness, I'm relieved to see you safe.

13:55.730 --> 13:56.970
Why are you holding his arm?

13:57.930 --> 14:01.840
It's not what it looks like!
They said they were scared, so I...

14:01.840 --> 14:05.380
That's right! Master Cain kept me safe!

14:05.380 --> 14:08.070
Master Cain is the strongest there is!

14:08.070 --> 14:11.450
I see. So you are Cain, then?

14:11.930 --> 14:15.130
I see. So it's you.

14:16.260 --> 14:20.720
I am the vice captain of the 
Royal Chivalric Order, Daim von Gazard.

14:21.330 --> 14:23.710
The knights have already
explained everything to me.

14:24.390 --> 14:27.780
I thank you for protecting
Her Highness and Miss Silk.

14:28.200 --> 14:31.560
You also brought my fallen comrades home.

14:31.560 --> 14:33.890
I thank you on behalf of their families.

14:34.510 --> 14:37.050
Thank you. I'll take them from here.

14:38.090 --> 14:40.940
Normally, we'd bring home their belongings

14:40.940 --> 14:43.400
and either bury or burn their
bodies where they fell.

14:44.410 --> 14:47.840
But thanks to you, we can
return them to their families.

14:48.600 --> 14:50.030
Sir Daim,

14:50.830 --> 14:58.930
these knights fought bravely against 
fifty orcs to protect the two young ladies.

15:00.000 --> 15:01.790
Please be sure to—

15:01.790 --> 15:05.920
I'll tell their fellow knights, as well
as the families who await their return.

15:06.280 --> 15:09.700
Our fallen knights' deaths were
not in vain, thanks to you.

15:16.460 --> 15:18.810
Well, I should go now...

15:20.390 --> 15:23.980
Wait a moment. You will have...

15:24.420 --> 15:26.190
an audience with the king.

15:26.190 --> 15:30.620
What?! An audience with the king as
soon as I arrive in the capital?!

15:30.620 --> 15:32.710
What's this all about?!

15:52.240 --> 15:53.470
Raise your head.

15:53.870 --> 15:54.640
Yes, Sire.

15:55.470 --> 16:00.090
On their journey here,
Princess Telestia and Miss Silk von Santana

16:00.090 --> 16:03.770
were attacked by a band of over fifty orcs.

16:04.010 --> 16:08.110
It was an organized orc army, no less,
including the top-ranked orc general.

16:09.380 --> 16:10.070
Truly?

16:10.370 --> 16:11.610
Silence!

16:12.080 --> 16:15.140
And then this young man, Cain von Silford,

16:15.140 --> 16:18.500
eliminated all of the orcs single-handedly.

16:18.500 --> 16:22.020
After the battle, he healed our
injured knights with healing magic,

16:22.020 --> 16:26.600
and he even brought our proud fallen
knights here to the royal capital.

16:27.210 --> 16:28.960
What? That little boy?

16:28.960 --> 16:30.090
All by himself?

16:30.090 --> 16:33.300
We shall therefore reward him. Your Majesty.

16:33.550 --> 16:36.450
You have done outstanding work.

16:36.840 --> 16:41.540
Had you not been there, neither Telestia
nor Miss Silk would have survived.

16:42.020 --> 16:43.020
Therefore...

16:43.280 --> 16:44.980
I hereby proclaim Cain von Silford

16:44.980 --> 16:46.810
a baron!

16:46.810 --> 16:48.830
Huh? A baron?

16:48.830 --> 16:52.400
I also grant you ten platinum coins
 and a mansion of your own.

16:52.400 --> 16:55.600
Impossible! A ten-year-old
can't be granted peerage!

16:55.600 --> 16:57.060
And he's even getting a mansion?!

16:57.060 --> 16:59.240
W-Wait just a minute!

16:59.520 --> 17:02.290
Granting a ten-year-old
peerage is unthinkable!

17:02.290 --> 17:04.180
He's still just a child!

17:04.180 --> 17:06.040
And platinum coins, too?!

17:06.040 --> 17:08.390
<i>They're right! I'm against this, too!</i>

17:08.390 --> 17:10.210
<i>I can't suddenly be a baron!</i>

17:10.500 --> 17:12.110
Quiet, Corgino!

17:12.110 --> 17:16.180
Could you have eliminated all those orcs
on your own like Cain did, then?!

17:17.110 --> 17:18.160
Well...

17:18.160 --> 17:19.490
Listen to me, Corgino.

17:19.490 --> 17:20.290
Yes, Sire.

17:20.290 --> 17:24.380
What good would it do to keep such a
talented young man in a powerless position?

17:24.840 --> 17:27.230
My decision will not be changed! Stand down!

17:28.550 --> 17:29.610
Very well.

17:30.810 --> 17:32.860
Cain von Silford.

17:33.110 --> 17:36.610
You will accept, won't you? Well?

17:36.870 --> 17:37.670
Yes, sire.

17:37.670 --> 17:40.080
<i>I don't have a choice at this point, do I?</i>

17:40.380 --> 17:43.090
I accept with gratitude.

17:43.540 --> 17:46.290
Good. Our audience is hereby ended.

17:47.100 --> 17:48.630
But you will not be leaving just yet.

17:49.320 --> 17:51.340
Come to the parlor next.

17:52.210 --> 17:56.670
I never expected you to be granted a peerage.

17:57.150 --> 17:59.540
I thought you were my third son,

17:59.540 --> 18:01.710
but you were the first to be promoted.

18:07.220 --> 18:09.360
<i>This isn't a situation where I can just say,</i>

18:09.360 --> 18:12.110
<i>"Thanks for being there
earlier," and wave back!</i>

18:12.320 --> 18:13.960
Thank you for waiting.

18:13.960 --> 18:17.130
This is not a formal audience. You may sit.

18:18.800 --> 18:21.830
Cain, I would first like to thank you.

18:22.180 --> 18:23.700
Thank you so much.

18:23.910 --> 18:25.180
Your Majesty?!

18:25.530 --> 18:28.420
Telestia has told me everything.

18:28.420 --> 18:29.710
Cain.

18:30.050 --> 18:32.540
Allow me to thank you, as well.

18:32.540 --> 18:36.250
I am Silk's father,
Eric von Santana Maalbeek.

18:36.570 --> 18:39.550
I truly thank you for what you've done.

18:39.820 --> 18:43.050
P-Please, everyone, raise your heads!

18:43.360 --> 18:47.500
I only jumped in to help when
I found people being attacked!

18:47.500 --> 18:54.180
But I do need to express my gratitude
not as a king, but as a father.

18:54.490 --> 18:57.030
Thank you, Cain.

18:58.070 --> 19:00.750
Now, let us talk about your future.

19:00.750 --> 19:02.800
I had thought that the only minors

19:02.800 --> 19:06.470
who could receive a peerage were
those who had lost their parents.

19:07.280 --> 19:09.130
He excels in both magic and the sword,

19:09.130 --> 19:11.180
and he has the protections of the gods.

19:11.610 --> 19:15.910
This kingdom is not so soft as to leave
such a talented child to his own devices.

19:16.250 --> 19:18.050
That is why I made him a baron.

19:18.290 --> 19:20.800
You will receive pay according
to the official regulations.

19:21.230 --> 19:22.930
Your mansion must be maintained, after all.

19:23.250 --> 19:25.890
If you have any questions
about nobility, ask Garm.

19:26.210 --> 19:27.760
Thank you very much.

19:27.760 --> 19:29.850
There is something more
important we must discuss.

19:31.280 --> 19:34.650
Would you take the hand of my Telestia...

19:34.650 --> 19:36.270
...and my Silk?

19:36.270 --> 19:37.440
What?!

19:37.730 --> 19:38.650
Oh, my!

19:38.950 --> 19:42.700
Of course, you won't be formally
married until you reach adulthood,

19:42.700 --> 19:45.210
but you can be engaged to them for now.

19:45.210 --> 19:47.910
E-Engaged?! But why?!

19:48.250 --> 19:50.370
I'm sure you have some idea why, Cain.

19:50.370 --> 19:52.440
Don't tell us you don't remember.

19:52.440 --> 19:53.770
After all...

19:54.240 --> 19:56.710
You linked arms with them in the carriage...

19:57.130 --> 20:01.190
and also slept with two unmarried ladies!

20:01.190 --> 20:03.090
And now that that's happened...

20:03.090 --> 20:04.970
...no one else will take them as brides.

20:04.970 --> 20:07.680
I didn't... do that because I wanted to...

20:07.680 --> 20:10.270
Are you unsatisfied with my daughter?!

20:10.270 --> 20:13.030
Th-That's not what I meant!

20:12.370 --> 20:13.480
<b>Let's Go Back in Time</b>

20:14.210 --> 20:18.070
Magna, what do you think 
I should do about this Cain boy?

20:18.390 --> 20:22.490
Well, how about granting him a peerage
and making him stand on his own?

20:22.490 --> 20:26.660
Giving him a mansion and having him
 live in it will show us who he truly is.

20:26.980 --> 20:32.240
Teles, Miss Silk, I've heard you are both
smitten with this young man who saved you.

20:32.240 --> 20:33.180
Oh, my!

20:33.180 --> 20:37.500
What if, for example, I said I wanted
one of you to be his fiancée?

20:37.770 --> 20:39.600
I want to be his fiancée!

20:39.600 --> 20:40.430
Huh?!

20:41.670 --> 20:45.300
Is this Cain truly that remarkable?

20:45.630 --> 20:46.890
All right, I've decided.

20:47.320 --> 20:52.100
I will keep this Cain boy
here in this kingdom!

20:50.200 --> 20:52.100
<b>Back to the Present</b>

20:52.380 --> 20:53.720
You will take her, yes?

20:53.720 --> 20:56.060
I need you to assume responsibility, Cain.

20:56.330 --> 20:59.520
Uh... This is all moving much too quickly!

20:59.730 --> 21:03.630
<i>But this is one of those things where
there's no way I can say no, right?</i>

21:03.630 --> 21:05.180
<i>What should I do?</i>

21:05.180 --> 21:05.780
Hmph.

21:05.780 --> 21:06.740
Huh?!

21:06.740 --> 21:08.830
Master Cain!

21:09.280 --> 21:10.680
Cain!

21:11.050 --> 21:11.770
Hmph.

21:12.900 --> 21:14.610
Very well.

21:14.610 --> 21:17.040
I accept the engagement.

21:18.410 --> 21:21.140
We have his word. Is this acceptable?

21:21.140 --> 21:21.880
Yes!

21:22.090 --> 21:25.560
I'll never forget the nights the
three of us slept so close together.

21:25.560 --> 21:29.130
I can't get those nights
out of my mind, either!

21:29.130 --> 21:30.020
"Those nights"?!

21:30.020 --> 21:32.470
"The nights the three of us
slept so close together"?!

21:33.390 --> 21:34.760
Cain!

21:34.760 --> 21:37.400
It was just... the positions of the beds!

21:37.400 --> 21:38.980
The positions of the beds?!

21:38.980 --> 21:40.900
I'm gonna get yelled at again!

21:41.820 --> 21:45.070
Cain! Show some discretion!

21:46.130 --> 21:49.030
I'm sorry!

23:19.440 --> 23:22.440
What's this about being
engaged to two pretty girls?!

23:22.440 --> 23:26.420
The king summoned me after that and
asked, "Is your son a philanderer?"

23:26.420 --> 23:27.340
Cain!

23:27.340 --> 23:28.010
Cain!

23:28.220 --> 23:32.110
I'm sorry! I won't philander again!

23:35.030 --> 23:36.510
<b>Preview</b>

23:35.490 --> 23:36.510
Teles here!

23:36.510 --> 23:37.520
Silk here!

23:36.910 --> 23:40.250
<b>"Debut in the Royal Capital"</b>

23:37.520 --> 23:39.980
Next time, "Debut in the Royal Capital."
